WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.200
Today's classrooms reflect the increasingly
mobile society we live in.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.720
The student population is becoming more diverse
and non-native speakers constitute a greater

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.320
portion of classrooms
than in previous generations, or even just

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.510
a few years ago.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.910
Parent-teacher conferences are a key instrument
for engaging parents

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.810
with their children's teachers and the school
community.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.509
But what if parents aren't fluent in the language
of their child's school?

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:36.570
How can they gain an accurate picture of their
child's progress?

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.230
How can they target areas for improvement
when there's

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.609
a communication gap with the instructor?

00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:46.350
Today, Microsoft offers a groundbreaking new
tool that bridges the gap

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:52.019
between parents and the teachers responsible
for their child's education.

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:57.870
Microsoft Translator provides real-time translation
in a free, easy-to-use tool

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.510
that works on any device with web capability.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.280
(Teacher speaking) "Welcome.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.280
Thank you so much again for coming today."

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.890
(Parent replies in Spanish)
(Teacher speaking) "Your son is very kind.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.810
He's doing really well in my class."

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:14.790
(Parent replies in Spanish)
(Teacher speaking) "Do you have any other

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.730
questions for me?"

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:19.800
Going beyond the classroom, there are situations
in education

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.070
where parents can benefit from real-time translation
into their native language.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:29.070
When parents are able to efficiently touch
base with school staff,

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:33.850
navigating school practices and policies becomes
effortless.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.250
There are many interactions between families
and schools

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.660
that are simplified with Translator.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:42.200
The set-up from Microsoft Translator is so
quick and easy.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:49.140
Just visit aka.ms/translatoredu to learn more
and download the app.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.410
Then start talking.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.720
Your conversations await.

